#
# ---- verdicts (2026-09-28, Vitreo build/src/vitreo of 2026-09-27 23:22, Apple M4 Pro) ----
# winoracle = WARP ("Microsoft Basic Render Driver", FL 11_1 device). The x86
# build (i686-w64-mingw32-gcc) printed byte-identical output on winoracle and
# under Vitreo (sections F C D N L), so every verdict holds for both bitnesses.
# Judge a new run with:  d3d11_a08_formats_check.py THIS_FILE vitreo.txt
# (it applies the D3D11.3 3.1/3.2/19.5 tolerances; '=' identical, 'ok' inside
# the rule, 'BAD' outside it, 'opt' optional capability not claimed).
# Checker counts for this run: ==477 ok=73 opt=27 BAD=237 DIFF=134
# (DIFF = CheckFormatSupport masks, owned by area 01, plus the lines below).
#
# Correct under Vitreo (identical or inside the spec rule):
#   create / initial data / CopyResource->STAGING / UpdateSubresource / Map
#   byte-exact for every mapped non-BC colour format; ld exact for UNORM,
#   SNORM (min -> -1; Vitreo exact where WARP is 1 ULP off for 3 values),
#   float16/11/10 (denorm, Inf, NaN), float32 (ld keeps denorms and NaN bits),
#   UINT/SINT, A8, BGRA; sRGB decode <= 0.391 ULP (0.5 allowed); point sample
#   == ld; RT and typed-UAV stores inside 0.6 ULP (UNORM/SNORM/sRGB), NaN -> 0
#   for SNORM (WARP writes 0x81), float16/11/10 RTZ + max-finite saturation
#   identical to WARP; blend <= 1 LSB; linear filtering incl. float32 and
#   sRGB-in-linear; BC1/BC2/BC7/BC6H 2D decode (BC1-3 colour within 1/255,
#   sRGB BC within 1.5/255 of WARP; BC6H/BC7 bit-identical).
#
# Wrong / missing under Vitreo (see .docs/audits/2026-09-28-d3d11-contract-audit/area-08-formats.md):
#   S  D045 srv47 (X24_TYPELESS_G8_UINT SRV of R24G8) -> host ABORT (Metal
#      view of Depth32Float_Stencil8 as X24_Stencil8/Invalid); Windows ld=(0,a5,0,1)
#   F070-F099 upd      UpdateSubresource on BC textures is a no-op
#   F070-F099 t3d      BC Texture3D CopyResource->STAGING reads zeros (Load is right)
#   F077/F078 ld       BC3 alpha 2/255 off (1/255 allowed)
#   F080-F084 ld       BC4/BC5 decoded with 1/64 weights: up to 0.0067 (U) / 0.018 (S) off; 1/65535, 1/32767 allowed
#   F019-F022 stage, F020 ds-init   D32S8X24 initial data truncated/garbled
#   F044-F047 stage/tex, F045 ds-init  D24S8 family refuses initial data / non-DS textures
#   F021/F022/F046/F047 tex  view-only depth formats refused as SRV textures
#   D*  ld             depth SRVs return (d,d,d,1); D3D (d,0,0,1). D24 not quantized (1 ULP)
#   C023/C027/C090/C033  R32_UINT UAV of 32-bit TYPELESS families refused (D3D11.3 5.3.9.5)
#   F029/F091 uavst    sRGB typed UAV accepted (Windows E_INVALIDARG)
#   shader CS*(resinfo on u#)  RWTexture*.GetDimensions does not translate (area 09)
#   MISSING formats (create E_INVALIDARG): 5-8 R32G32B32*, 67 R9G9B9E5, 68/69
#   RGBG/GRGB, 85 B5G6R5, 86 B5G5R5A1, 88/92/93 B8G8R8X8*, 89 XR_BIAS, 115
#   B4G4R4A4, 103 NV12, 104 P010, 105 P016, 107 YUY2 (and optional 100-102,
#   108/109, 113/114 that WARP supports)
